<title>USA: Pacificare Health gets line of credit.</title>
<headline>Pacificare Health gets line of credit.</headline>
<dateline>CYPRESS, Calif 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>PacifiCare Health Systems Inc said it established a $1.5 billion revolving line of credit with Bank of America, as agent, and a syndicate of other financial institutions.</p>
<p>The new line of credit will be used to finance the cash portion of the FHP International acquisition, for fees and expenses relating to the acquisition and for general corporate purposes. Funding under the revolving line of credit is subject to various customary borrowing conditions.</p>
</text>
